Architectural Invariants

The current TenantSage architecture is governed by the following invariants:

No Verified Identity → No Authority

No Proven Authority → No Governance Allow

No Governance Allow → No EEB

No Sealed EEB → No Retrieval

Retrieved Evidence ⊆ Sealed EEB

No Verified Retrieval Proof → No Governed Context

No Governed Context → No Generation

No Durable Context Proof → No Generation

No Verified S1–S6 Lineage → No ValidationApproval

No ValidationApproval → No ExecutionIntent

No Durable Intent Proof → No Execution

No Durable Completion Proof → No Successful Execution Claim

No Replay Proof → No Response Release

