What TenantSage Is Not

TenantSage is not:

* a chatbot
* a foundation model
* a vector database
* a generic search engine
* a prompt framework
* an IAM replacement
* a document-management system
* a generic ingestion platform
* a conventional RAG application

TenantSage consumes and governs those systems rather than attempting to replace them.

